Agent Rotate integrates the MIT-licensed claude-rotate package by evrenverse
(https://github.com/evrenverse/claude-rotate), pinned in pyproject.toml and uv.lock.
That dependency retains its upstream source and license. Its OAuth and credential
management implementation is used through its package interface, not copied here.

Claude, Anthropic, Codex, OpenAI, and ChatGPT are names of their respective owners.
This is an independent project, not an official provider product.

Feature research for 0.2.0 reviewed these MIT-licensed projects:
vaskoyudha/CodexCLI-Rotate (vaskoyudha and contributors), realiti4/claude-swap
(Onur Cetinkol), and uwuclxdy/clauth (cloudy). Their interface/policy ideas informed
the roadmap; no implementation code was copied. Pinned source references are in
docs/feature-research.md.
